+      // `program_source:<line>:<col>` against generated MSL that nothing has
+      // ever printed, so a codegen bug otherwise surfaces as an error message
+      // with no way to see what produced it. Print a window around every line
+      // the message names rather than the whole shader, which runs to
+      // thousands of lines for a Taichi megakernel.
+      log_msl_source_context(source, description);
